                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A good example of one of Gestmorph Games' earliest (publicly released) titles and one that still stands up to the test of time even now, nine years later. Prism Collider is a retro-inspired puzzle game with some cool neon aesthetics. The simple goal of making it to the end of each level steadily increases with each passing area. You will legitimately get a run for your money in the later levels difficulty-wise. With good level design and a great soundtrack, this is one worth coming back to for sure!",
